==Battleground==
===<u>Chapters 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hippoe|Those Guys|Hyppoh}}
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns as the boss.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hippoe|Those Guys|Hyppoh}}
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Do not use [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] or [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Solar Cat]] - all three are outranged by Hyppoh.

Try to build up to a maxed [[Worker Cat]] and wallet before stacking as many [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] as possible. Once Hyppoh spawns, your ranged attackers should be able to overwhelm her as long as you protect them with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]]. If you still can't win, getting more [[Treasure]]s and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] should do the trick.

